<<set $readWIP1 = true>>To: Penny \nFrom: Info@WIP.org \nSubject: First assignment
Dear Penelope, \nThank you again for volunteering with WIP. As you know, we're an organization that matches crafters with the loved ones of people who have died or 
otherwise left projects incomplete. Your work is extraordinarily meaningful to these grieving families and friends. \nYour first project is to complete a baby hat for
the granddaughter of Rhonda Milstein, an avid knitter who passed away last year at the age of 84. Kara Milstein was cleaning out her grandmother's house when she found
this project, which she'd like to give to her own newborn daughter. Should you accept, we'll send along a package with the unfinished hat that should arrive today.
Yours in fiber, \nWIP
\n
-> Accept? 
    <<set $hat0 = true>><<jump Email>>
-> Decline?
    <<jump Email>>
