<<movePenny(80,123)>><<pennyKnitting(7)>>It's a little weird \nworking on a project
someone else started.
This hat is made of really nice yarn --
Rhonda Milstein had \ngood taste.
She was so neat in her stitches.
Mine look so sloppy by comparison.
But I like doing this. 
It feels good.
...
...
...
...
There. I'll mark the spot where I
started knitting and send it off.
<<endPennyKnitting()>>
